What this is
------------

The OpenClaw skill that registers any OpenClaw agent as a reduced-trust
member of an org. Published to ClawHub as `orrery-org`. Conforms to the
org protocol v0.3 by default, with a v0.2 fallback for older orgs.

Relationship to the protocol
----------------------------

This skill is one reference runtime of the org protocol — the
reduced-trust client surface. It is part of Orrery
(https://github.com/Sharathvc23/orrery-public).

